Material Icon Theme v5.40.0 file and folder icons and associations
https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme/releases/tag/v5.40.0
Upstream source commit: 045291ff033062a25441dd297fd51546326866f2
The release manifest supplies the default mappings. Other upstream icon packs supply additional associations where the defaults have no entry.
Zeus combines the upstream light and dark variants into individual SVGs and adapts the light database icon fill.

